?\r\n\r\n- Closes #121556 \r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\n<img width=\"448\" height=\"203\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68b76811-4739-4d19-bd0a-465195afd85f\" />\r\n\r\nIf `checking` is `false` (when one `Resource`, is selected) we don't emit `property_list_changed`, but if it's `true`, we do, which causes the various problems in the linked issue. I have removed the `notify_property_list_changed`, to be consistent with the other path, and to fix the issue.\r\n\r\n## Video of the new behaviour\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abb915cf-3fe6-47b1-a5dd-2d07f35d606e\r\n\r\n## Additional info\r\n\r\nTested. \r\nNo AI was used.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.c